Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Can we address this hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}What does the 2024 mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}この帽子の話をしようか　「2024」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}どういう意味？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:06.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}2024...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:06.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}2024は…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.03,0:00:09.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.03,0:00:09.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}出馬だよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:13.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It's time for us to rise up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:13.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}俺たちが立ち上がる時だ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.11,0:00:18.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It's time for us to put
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.11,0:00:18.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}somebody in office that is us,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.11,0:00:18.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺たちの側の人間を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.11,0:00:18.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺たちを気にかける人間を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:19.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}that cares about us,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:19.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}政権に就ける時だ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:23.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}that serves God and serves the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:23.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}people. That's what 2024 means.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:23.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}神に仕え　人々に仕える人間をな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:23.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}それが2024の意味だ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:27.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So you can't say this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:27.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}じゃあ今は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:27.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}まだ言えないってことか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ってことは…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Ye might be against...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}But what if Trump runs?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Yeが対抗するのは…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}でもトランプが出たら？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:37.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}No, that's... He might. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:37.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}いや、それは…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:37.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}出るかもな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:42.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I think that's what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:42.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}America's been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:42.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}アメリカはそれを
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:42.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}待ってたんだと思うよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.21,0:00:44.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You against Trump?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.21,0:00:44.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}トランプと対決？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.65,0:00:47.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah. Who you voting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.65,0:00:47.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}そう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.65,0:00:47.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}あんたは誰に投票する？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:51.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:51.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}いい質問だな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.10,0:00:56.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'm not even going to lie, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.10,0:00:56.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I'm a fan of a lot of people, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.10,0:00:56.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ウソはつかないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.10,0:00:56.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ファンな人はたくさんいる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:59.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}you know, respectfully, I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:59.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}like nobody better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:59.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でも悪いけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:59.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺より好きな奴はいない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:00.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:00.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}なるほど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.66,0:01:04.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}If he asked you to be VP, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.66,0:01:04.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}もしトランプに副大統領を頼まれたら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.66,0:01:04.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}やる？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.77,0:01:10.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah. Absolutely. If that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.77,0:01:10.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}was a piece that's like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.77,0:01:10.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ああ、もちろん
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.77,0:01:10.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}それは俺にとって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:11.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}let's say, Watch the Throne then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:11.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}『Watch the Throne』みたいなもんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:14.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Well, you thought he was the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:14.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}VP on Watch the Throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:14.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}『Watch the Throne』では
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:14.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}Jayが副大統領だったって？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:16.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I thought you was
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:16.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}equals, co-president.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:16.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}対等な共同大統領だと思ってたわ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:19.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But still, that's my elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:19.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}That's my senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:19.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でもやっぱり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:19.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}あの人は俺の先輩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}That's the person with more
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}experience. I love the respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}経験も上だ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}その敬意が大事なんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:16.55,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1188)\fs40}『Watch the Throne』：2011年の
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:16.55,Expl,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fs40}Jay-ZとYeの共作アルバム
